Note: bench_parse.flow
Note: Hot path measured: SimpleLexer + Parser on long file with many imports.
Note: Loads 4 stdlib modules + 5 relative-path import targets, then parses
Note: ~25000 groups (~125k lines). Parse walk dominates.
Note: Tuning history: 50 groups=0.57s, 200=0.57s, 3000=0.69s, 10000=1.04s.
Note: Lexer+parser are very fast; 25000 groups targets ~2-3s. Execution per stmt is
Note: trivial; parse+lex+import dominate.

